      <Desc>THE CORPORATION OPERATES A 60-UNIT APARTMENT BUILDING FOR LOW-INCOME ELDERLY AND HANDICAPPED INDIVIDUALS UNDER THE NATIONAL HOUSING ACT. ON MAY 12, 2021, THE CORPORATION SOLD THE BUILDING TO CRP ST. STEPHEN'S APARTMENTS, L.P. TO OPERATE AS A QUALIFIED LOW-INCOME HOUSING PROJECT WITHIN THE MEANING OF SECTION 42 OF THE INTERNAL REVENUE CODE. THE CORPORATION CONTINUES TO OWN A PERCENTAGE OF THE TAXABLE ENTITY AND HOLDS A NOTE RECEIVABLE FOR THE SELLER FINANCING PROVIDED.</Desc>
